## Summary
Work since the last commit (9d01eb91, 21 Jul 2026) adds three major modules (Tasks & Follow-ups, Warranty Manager, Vendor master), tightens work-request / work-order lifecycle, moves static assets to ImageKit, and refreshes auth email plus company-master detail UX.

## New modules

### Tasks & Follow-ups
- Full task manager: list, kanban, create/edit, detail, comments, activity, attachments
- Voice assistant for task capture
- Configurable statuses/priorities, recurrence, reminders, visibility
- Server: task service, scheduler, recurrence/reminder jobs, attachment storage
- SQL: 53-task-management, 54-task-meta-descriptions, 59-task-spec-compliance, 60-task-performance
- Permissions: 48-warranty-tasks-permissions

### Warranty Manager
- Warranty records, line items, serial format (WM/YYYY/0000), vendor link, document attachments
- SQL: 49-warranty-manager, 51-warranty-vendor-link, 52-warranty-serial-format, 55-warranty-documents, 56-org-assets-warranty-documents

### Vendor master
- Vendor CRUD, list/detail pages, bulk import, validation
- SQL: 50-vendor-master
- Server: vendorService, vendorBulkService, /api/vendors

## Work requests & work orders
- WR/WO CMMS lifecycle (numbering, source, planning, permits, execution docs, timeline, WR↔WO sync)
- SQL: 61-work-order-wr-spec-compliance, 47-approve-permissions
- Work-order lifecycle panel, stronger WR filters/list table, bulk of workRequestService updates
- Approve permissions for WR/WO

## Company masters & UI
- Clickable master tables with shared record-detail modal/layout
- Employee detail page (16 Aug): profile header, Active badge, Overview / Activity / Permissions / Security tabs, 2×2 cards (Contact, Organization, Access & Login, Notes), created/updated/member-since footer
- Shared table toolbar: search, filter, sort, column picker, pagination prefs
- Master bulk upload for employees (and related import helpers)
- Shared DetailView, RecordDetailModal, RecordDetailLayout, PageBack
- Red back button throughout detail views using ImageKit arrow-left2-outline.svg; returns to the previous screen
- Locations / departments / areas / equipment detail views use the same record-detail pattern
- Roles & Access list/filter improvements
- Dialogs: full-page overlays beside the sidebar (dialogs.css)

## Auth / password-reset email
- Branded MMS PRO reset/setup email (desktop + mobile)
- Hero images and logo from ImageKit:
  - Desktop: images/logindesktop.png
  - Mobile: images/loginmobile.png
  - Logo: images/logo.svg
- Full-width layout (no grey gutter card)
- No CID/inline attachments; icons load from hosted ImageKit URLs
- Templates: server/templates/password-reset.html and supabase/email-templates/password-reset.html

## Assets & infra
- Static images/icons served from ImageKit (client/src/lib/assets.js, VITE_IMAGEKIT_URL_ENDPOINT)
- Local public icons/images removed in favor of ImageKit; keep a few new icons (filter, sort, upload, email-*)
- Vite PWA/proxy/ngrok host allowances, Vercel routing updates
- Node 24 (.nvmrc, engines)
- Performance indexes: 57-performance-indexes-2, 58-trigram-search-indexes
- India locations helper, job queue, company master bulk service
- Dev tunnel script (scripts/)

