Do not commit
-------------
- client/.env, server/.env (secrets)
- node_modules/, client/node_modules/, server/node_modules/
- client/dist/ (build output)
- .DS_Store
- Accidental npm package "24" in root package.json if that was not intentional
- node_modules/.DS_Store and other junk under node_modules

Suggested git add (safe)
------------------------
Source, SQL patches, templates, docs, .nvmrc, .env.example files, public icons that are new.
Exclude env files, dist, node_modules, and OS junk.


